{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A light rogue-lite game blending horror elements, collection, and action combat. Designed as a 2D side-scrolling platformer, it features exploratory storytelling and text-based dialogue, creating a strange and twisted world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Characters with Unique Styles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a roster of characters, each with unique skills and combat styles. From shield-wielding warriors to necromancers, players can choose their preferred hero and unlock diverse combat experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/c266168a37e0641a865019554c3df5e3.avif?t=1753497201\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/bb9cfbea655c140d8c08674aabacf1e1.poster.avif?t=1753497201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/bb9cfbea655c140d8c08674aabacf1e1.webm?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/bb9cfbea655c140d8c08674aabacf1e1.mp4?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creepy Horror Atmosphere with Immersive Experience</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilizing horror game aesthetics, the game builds a dense and eerie atmosphere through dim lighting, oppressive sound effects, and distorted visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/desc_1.gif?t=1753497201\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/d5f6812e0408167a5800e1b442f21d95.poster.avif?t=1753497201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/d5f6812e0408167a5800e1b442f21d95.webm?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/d5f6812e0408167a5800e1b442f21d95.mp4?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Randomly Assembled Levels, Endless Exploration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soul-collection stages are built from pre-made rooms randomly assembled, with one-way progression and lucky rooms that make every adventure a unique journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/eb1271a353a8d818cdcf9ce6518e9ffb.poster.avif?t=1753497201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/eb1271a353a8d818cdcf9ce6518e9ffb.webm?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/eb1271a353a8d818cdcf9ce6518e9ffb.mp4?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soul-Based Progression</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instead of linear upgrades, players enhance their attributes by collecting souls. Failing to collect them empowers the enemy instead, creating a balance-of-power mechanic represented as a scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/938ea1c49244ffc66124de6790e222bf.poster.avif?t=1753497201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/938ea1c49244ffc66124de6790e222bf.webm?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/938ea1c49244ffc66124de6790e222bf.mp4?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Boss Battles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss features unique attack patterns and mechanics that challenge the player\u2019s reflexes. Defeating a boss unlocks new abilities, further expanding combat possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/abe847ca1e1335589f3f374aad4d66e0.poster.avif?t=1753497201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/abe847ca1e1335589f3f374aad4d66e0.webm?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/abe847ca1e1335589f3f374aad4d66e0.mp4?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3774410?t=1753497201","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3774410?t=1753497201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/b16679c1f126b6688ec04be3c4349518a308dc34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753497201","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/b16679c1f126b6688ec04be3c4349518a308dc34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753497201","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3885370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A light rogue-lite game blending horror elements, collection, and action combat. Designed as a 2D side-scrolling platformer, it features exploratory storytelling and text-based dialogue, creating a strange and twisted world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Characters with Unique Styles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a roster of characters, each with unique skills and combat styles. From shield-wielding warriors to necromancers, players can choose their preferred hero and unlock diverse combat experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/c266168a37e0641a865019554c3df5e3.avif?t=1753497201\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/bb9cfbea655c140d8c08674aabacf1e1.poster.avif?t=1753497201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/bb9cfbea655c140d8c08674aabacf1e1.webm?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/bb9cfbea655c140d8c08674aabacf1e1.mp4?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creepy Horror Atmosphere with Immersive Experience</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilizing horror game aesthetics, the game builds a dense and eerie atmosphere through dim lighting, oppressive sound effects, and distorted visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/desc_1.gif?t=1753497201\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/d5f6812e0408167a5800e1b442f21d95.poster.avif?t=1753497201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/d5f6812e0408167a5800e1b442f21d95.webm?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/d5f6812e0408167a5800e1b442f21d95.mp4?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Randomly Assembled Levels, Endless Exploration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soul-collection stages are built from pre-made rooms randomly assembled, with one-way progression and lucky rooms that make every adventure a unique journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/eb1271a353a8d818cdcf9ce6518e9ffb.poster.avif?t=1753497201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/eb1271a353a8d818cdcf9ce6518e9ffb.webm?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/eb1271a353a8d818cdcf9ce6518e9ffb.mp4?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soul-Based Progression</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instead of linear upgrades, players enhance their attributes by collecting souls. Failing to collect them empowers the enemy instead, creating a balance-of-power mechanic represented as a scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/938ea1c49244ffc66124de6790e222bf.poster.avif?t=1753497201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/938ea1c49244ffc66124de6790e222bf.webm?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/938ea1c49244ffc66124de6790e222bf.mp4?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Boss Battles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss features unique attack patterns and mechanics that challenge the player\u2019s reflexes. Defeating a boss unlocks new abilities, further expanding combat possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/abe847ca1e1335589f3f374aad4d66e0.poster.avif?t=1753497201\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/abe847ca1e1335589f3f374aad4d66e0.webm?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/abe847ca1e1335589f3f374aad4d66e0.mp4?t=1753497201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","developers":["SpringBone"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"descrip